WEBVTT

1
00:50:47.074 --> 00:50:52.914
We confess that we need you today. We confess, Lord Jesus, we need you.

2
00:50:54.034 --> 00:51:01.554
We need you, Lord. The earth groans, the earth groans, the nations are shaking. Lord,

3
00:51:01.554 --> 00:51:07.874
we need you. You are the answer. You are the solution. We declare anew.

4
00:51:07.874 --> 00:51:14.194
The House of the Lord is a city on a hill. It is a place where the Light of Christ can be seen

5
00:51:14.194 --> 00:51:21.794
and felt. Lord, your house is a place of Light. It is the place of purpose. It is the place of

6
00:51:21.794 --> 00:51:27.714
Light in the Lord Jesus Christ. We declare this morning that your house is the place of truth

7
00:51:27.714 --> 00:51:35.394
in all nations. Let the houses of God be filled with truth, with the Light of Christ

8
00:51:35.394 --> 00:51:42.114
and let all thunder be bound in the name of Jesus. Come on, mean, mean, mean.

9
00:51:43.314 --> 00:51:51.474
Jesus, we need you. Mean, sustainable purpose, sustainable purpose. We need Jesus Christ.

10
00:51:52.354 --> 00:51:58.434
We need his blood. We need his body. There is no other answer.

11
00:51:58.434 --> 00:52:06.514
Church, earth, there is no other way. There is only one way.

12
00:52:09.634 --> 00:52:14.754
We declare and declare anew. There is no other way to the Father.

13
00:52:14.754 --> 00:52:20.834
There is only one way through the cross, through the crucified Christ,

14
00:52:22.834 --> 00:52:27.234
through the blood and through the body of Jesus Christ.

15
00:52:29.394 --> 00:52:36.114
Oh, let your house be a house of truth. Let your house be a house on a hill.

16
00:52:37.554 --> 00:52:42.674
Fill God again with truth. Fill it with the Light of the intentions of the Gentiles.

17
00:52:43.714 --> 00:52:48.674
Oh, fill it with the sense of urgency and sustainability.

18
00:52:49.234 --> 00:53:05.234
Sustainability, sustainable mind, sustainable spirits, in the name of the Lord, for the day is near. Amen?

19
00:53:05.234 --> 00:53:11.074
The day is near for the return of the Lord. Lord, we see you. We feel you.

20
00:53:11.794 --> 00:53:15.474
We know that you are closer than the first day we believed.

21
00:53:15.474 --> 00:53:17.714
We know that you are closer than the first day we believed.

22
00:53:22.594 --> 00:53:27.954
All the fuss, all the fright is the sign that you are closer than the first day we believed.

23
00:53:27.954 --> 00:53:34.194
You are closer than the first day we believed. We know that it all comes down to the one man. Amen?

24
00:53:34.194 --> 00:53:41.314
So, Lord, we honor you, we exalt you in this house and we worship you in spirit and truth.

25
00:53:42.274 --> 00:53:48.674
Not only with songs, but also with our bodies, with our lives that are at the feet of the cross.

26
00:53:48.674 --> 00:53:52.674
And I call some of you this morning, back to the Lord completely.

27
00:53:53.794 --> 00:53:59.394
Not only with your song this morning, but also with your body, with your spirit, with your soul.

28
00:53:59.394 --> 00:54:01.314
The day is urgent, friends.

29
00:54:02.194 --> 00:54:08.354
Let me tell you, it is urgent. You must respond to the hand of the love of Jesus Christ.

30
00:54:08.754 --> 00:54:14.114
There is no other answer for you in your household. There is only one. Amen?

31
00:54:14.114 --> 00:54:16.674
So we pray earnestly for your soul today.

32
00:54:17.394 --> 00:54:22.514
And I will ask at the end of the service that some of our leaders are here to receive you and pray.

33
00:54:22.514 --> 00:54:24.834
The day is urgent, friend.

34
00:54:26.114 --> 00:54:28.434
And if you do not feel that, I feel it for you.

35
00:54:28.434 --> 00:54:32.994
The day is urgent for your soul to return to the Lord Jesus Christ.

36
00:54:34.754 --> 00:54:35.714
It is urgent.

37
00:54:36.114 --> 00:54:39.154
So we take a soft moment to pray. Amen?

38
00:54:40.514 --> 00:54:44.514
Okay, I will catch Tommy and Saskia. I think this is a good moment.

39
00:54:45.474 --> 00:54:49.074
Those who carry the play and those who want to pray the play on the street. Amen?

40
00:55:06.034 --> 00:55:10.354
So the church of Jesus Christ, in the kingdom of God there are many rooms.

41
00:55:10.354 --> 00:55:12.674
In the kingdom of God, there are many tasks.

42
00:55:13.874 --> 00:55:16.274
The task of the church is to teach.

43
00:55:16.274 --> 00:55:22.354
The task of the church is to prophetically declare how the fork of God can live with God.

44
00:55:23.154 --> 00:55:25.394
The task of the church is to pray.

45
00:55:25.394 --> 00:55:29.234
The task of the church is to heal in the name of Jesus.

46
00:55:29.394 --> 00:55:33.154
The task of the church is to have authority in the society in which we stand.

47
00:55:33.154 --> 00:55:37.554
And one of the tasks of the congregation is to evangelize.

48
00:55:37.554 --> 00:55:41.234
This comes from a Greek word, euangelion.

49
00:55:41.234 --> 00:55:45.874
And that Greek word means bringing good news.

50
00:55:46.834 --> 00:55:53.714
Did you know that good news does not mean we have to force people to come in your name?

51
00:55:53.874 --> 00:55:59.954
Did you know that good news does not mean we have to force people to believe in Jesus?

52
00:55:59.954 --> 00:56:01.954
That is not evangelizing.

53
00:56:01.954 --> 00:56:04.594
Evangelizing is bringing good news.

54
00:56:04.594 --> 00:56:08.434
It is simply the statement, Jesus is here.

55
00:56:08.434 --> 00:56:10.114
That is evangelizing.

56
00:56:10.114 --> 00:56:11.474
I have good news.

57
00:56:11.474 --> 00:56:12.354
Jesus is here.

58
00:56:12.354 --> 00:56:13.954
That is evangelizing.

59
00:56:13.954 --> 00:56:18.674
The people standing next to me are evangelists at heart and soul.

60
00:56:18.754 --> 00:56:25.634
They have received a grace gift from God to be able to go out on the street.

61
00:56:25.634 --> 00:56:29.154
To sometimes receive 90% resistance.

62
00:56:29.154 --> 00:56:33.714
But to be happy with the 10% good conversations they can have in a day.

63
00:56:34.914 --> 00:56:38.354
And you know, this sounds very weak about myself, but I have to admit it.

64
00:56:38.354 --> 00:56:44.594
If I am insulted by 9 people on the street, I go home defeated.

65
00:56:44.594 --> 00:56:48.194
But they laugh, because they had one good conversation.

66
00:56:48.194 --> 00:56:50.834
And that is a grace gift that you receive from the Lord.

67
00:56:50.834 --> 00:56:52.434
To be able to evangelize.

68
00:56:52.434 --> 00:56:54.914
To do it over and over again.

69
00:56:54.914 --> 00:56:58.274
To be completely free from pride.

70
00:56:58.274 --> 00:57:01.874
And to go out on the street and say, Jesus Christ is here.

71
00:57:01.874 --> 00:57:03.554
Jesus Christ is here.

72
00:57:03.554 --> 00:57:08.274
And so, we want to ask Saskia and Tommy to just share a bit.

73
00:57:08.274 --> 00:57:12.514
And also to tell what we do as a church, as evangelism.

74
00:57:13.474 --> 00:57:15.474
Yes, yes.

75
00:57:15.474 --> 00:57:18.754
Yes, how can I actually add to that?

76
00:57:18.754 --> 00:57:21.154
Tim has already said everything.

77
00:57:21.154 --> 00:57:23.794
We regularly go out on the street.

78
00:57:23.794 --> 00:57:26.114
Indeed to bring the good news.

79
00:57:26.114 --> 00:57:29.314
Not to judge people, but to tell them that there is hope.

80
00:57:29.314 --> 00:57:31.794
And that there is a God who loves them.

81
00:57:31.794 --> 00:57:36.674
And indeed, as we just told, liberation is possible.

82
00:57:36.674 --> 00:57:42.034
From everything that may seem to give us freedom in life, but actually is not.

83
00:57:42.034 --> 00:57:43.474
Because it holds us back.

84
00:57:43.474 --> 00:57:47.474
And every time we go, we do not only tell people one on one.

85
00:57:47.474 --> 00:57:49.474
But we also shout it out in the streets.

86
00:57:49.474 --> 00:57:50.994
That God loves them.

87
00:57:50.994 --> 00:57:52.514
And that there is hope.

88
00:57:52.514 --> 00:57:56.594
And that there is a choice to be made that offers life.

89
00:57:56.594 --> 00:57:59.714
And again these days we will go out into the streets.

90
00:57:59.714 --> 00:58:01.714
And this time not alone.

91
00:58:01.714 --> 00:58:10.354
Yes, because from September 18 to 21 there is a grand event in Eindhoven.

92
00:58:10.434 --> 00:58:14.834
For Eindhoven is celebrating, yes, 80 years of liberation from the war.

93
00:58:14.834 --> 00:58:17.714
But we have eternal liberation from Jesus Christ.

94
00:58:17.714 --> 00:58:24.914
So there will be no less than 19 evangelism teams active over 4 days.

95
00:58:24.914 --> 00:58:31.394
And we, hallelujah, we get to participate here on Saturday, September 20.

96
00:58:31.394 --> 00:58:35.394
From 2 to 5 PM we have a spot in the center of Eindhoven.

97
00:58:35.394 --> 00:58:39.794
We have already made a short announcement in the evangelism app, in the church app.

98
00:58:39.954 --> 00:58:43.874
There, I saw this morning, 14 people have already signed up.

99
00:58:43.874 --> 00:58:45.074
Hallelujah.

100
00:58:45.074 --> 00:58:47.234
Do you think, I want to join too.

101
00:58:47.234 --> 00:58:50.034
I want to tell people about the good news.

102
00:58:50.034 --> 00:58:52.914
I want to move hearts, change lives.

103
00:58:52.914 --> 00:58:54.274
Yes, there is resistance.

104
00:58:54.274 --> 00:58:58.514
But through that resistance, the name of Jesus rings out.

105
00:58:58.514 --> 00:59:02.434
And He is always greater, always more beautiful, always more powerful.

106
00:59:02.434 --> 00:59:04.434
And we do not take the resistance home with us.

107
00:59:04.434 --> 00:59:06.594
But we take the testimonies home with us.

108
00:59:06.594 --> 00:59:07.954
The lives that have been changed.

109
00:59:07.954 --> 00:59:10.914
And the people we have met who were willing to listen.

110
00:59:10.914 --> 00:59:15.634
And for the people who did not want to listen or think they have a bigger voice or a louder

111
00:59:15.634 --> 00:59:16.914
voice than we do.

112
00:59:16.914 --> 00:59:21.234
Because sometimes we are simply drowned out when praying for these people.

113
00:59:21.234 --> 00:59:23.314
Because they need it even more.

114
00:59:23.314 --> 00:59:24.674
In the name of Jesus.

115
00:59:24.674 --> 00:59:41.394
Yes, what I can add to these words is that the Bible says how beautiful are the feet

116
00:59:41.394 --> 00:59:43.714
of those who bring the good news.

117
00:59:43.714 --> 00:59:45.074
How beautiful.

118
00:59:45.074 --> 00:59:46.114
Oh.

119
00:59:55.394 --> 01:00:03.794
How beautiful are the feet of those who come to bring the good news.

120
01:00:03.794 --> 01:00:16.594
And the Bible says, Jesus speaks there, and whoever the Lord has set free is truly free.

121
01:00:16.914 --> 01:00:27.794
And the Bible says that where the Spirit of the Lord is, there is freedom.

122
01:00:27.794 --> 01:00:40.914
So if you are here today, if you believe that Jesus has set you free, then I call on you

123
01:00:41.074 --> 01:00:46.674
to join us on Saturday to check your freedom.

124
01:00:46.674 --> 01:00:48.674
Hallelujah.

125
01:00:48.674 --> 01:00:54.114
You are called to give your testimony.

126
01:00:54.114 --> 01:00:57.554
You have a powerful testimony.

127
01:00:57.554 --> 01:01:08.594
And Jesus asks you to join us to give your testimony, so that people

128
01:01:08.754 --> 01:01:13.714
can be set free, free from addictions.

129
01:01:13.714 --> 01:01:22.674
For we believe that Jesus has already done it in the past, and that he will do it again.

130
01:01:22.674 --> 01:01:23.634
Amen.

131
01:01:23.634 --> 01:01:25.634
So we sing, we proclaim Jesus from the rooftops.

132
01:01:30.674 --> 01:01:36.594
There he is, right.

133
01:01:36.674 --> 01:01:38.674
Can we give him a round of applause, for he is truly amazing.

134
01:01:38.674 --> 01:01:42.674
Praise the Lord, praise the Lord.

135
01:01:42.674 --> 01:01:44.674
So we have that app, the Open Church app, and it includes that evangelism group.

136
01:01:52.674 --> 01:01:58.674
And they take a bit of the lead in that, they can write things down in there.

137
01:01:58.674 --> 01:02:04.674
And we want to call the church, so you can just join us.

138
01:02:04.754 --> 01:02:08.754
Then you will know what the agenda is, then you will know what the intentions are, to go there

139
01:02:08.754 --> 01:02:12.754
to evangelize, then in that city, then in that village.

140
01:02:12.754 --> 01:02:16.754


141
01:02:16.754 --> 01:02:18.754
And let us build on that.

142
01:02:18.754 --> 01:02:22.754
Because one of the things we need to do is evangelism.

143
01:02:22.754 --> 01:02:26.754
When I evangelize, I evangelize full throttle on the street.

144
01:02:26.754 --> 01:02:30.754
I evangelize when I am exercising, I evangelize when I am walking in the store,

145
01:02:30.834 --> 01:02:32.834
I evangelize when I see situations.

146
01:02:32.834 --> 01:02:36.834
But street evangelism is a different technique.

147
01:02:36.834 --> 01:02:40.834
Street evangelism is standing on a corner and proclaiming it.

148
01:02:40.834 --> 01:02:44.834
Jesus is here, what you just heard.

149
01:02:44.834 --> 01:02:47.834
That is street evangelism, evangelism.

150
01:02:47.834 --> 01:02:49.834
And that is a very powerful ministry.

151
01:02:49.834 --> 01:02:53.834
Paul did this, the disciples did this, the apostles did this.

152
01:02:53.834 --> 01:02:56.834
And today we still do this in the mighty name of Jesus.

153
01:02:56.834 --> 01:02:59.834
And I am proud that we do this as a church.

154
01:02:59.914 --> 01:03:01.914
In Jesus' mighty name.

155
01:03:01.914 --> 01:03:03.914
Thank you very much.

156
01:03:03.914 --> 01:03:05.914
At the end here.

157
01:03:05.914 --> 01:03:07.914
Where? In the small hall?

158
01:03:07.914 --> 01:03:13.914
Okay, so in the small hall there is a short meeting after this church service, informative.

159
01:03:13.914 --> 01:03:18.914
So if you are participating, those fourteen people who have signed up or if you want to be there.

160
01:03:18.914 --> 01:03:20.914
Then please go to the small hall after the service.

161
01:03:20.914 --> 01:03:23.914
Then there is a brief discussion about how, what, where.

162
01:03:23.914 --> 01:03:25.914
Not why, because that is the name of Jesus.

163
01:03:25.914 --> 01:03:26.914
But how, what, and where.

164
01:03:26.914 --> 01:03:27.914
Amen?

165
01:03:27.914 --> 01:03:28.914
Amen.

166
01:03:28.994 --> 01:03:29.994
Amen.

167
01:03:29.994 --> 01:03:30.994
Praise God.

168
01:03:35.994 --> 01:03:38.994
I have something to share today about giving.

169
01:03:38.994 --> 01:03:41.994
Let's take a look at what the Bible says about it.

170
01:03:46.994 --> 01:03:48.994
Yes, there he is.

171
01:03:48.994 --> 01:03:54.994
Jesus said to his disciples, therefore I tell you, do not worry about anything.

172
01:03:55.074 --> 01:04:00.074
We are currently living in a world where everything is becoming more expensive.

173
01:04:00.074 --> 01:04:05.074
And where, for example, it is difficult to find a house or a job.

174
01:04:05.074 --> 01:04:09.074
But Jesus says, do not worry about anything.

175
01:04:09.074 --> 01:04:12.074
Not whether you will have food and drink.

176
01:04:12.074 --> 01:04:16.074
Nor whether you will have clothes to wear.

177
01:04:16.074 --> 01:04:19.074
Life itself is more important than food.

178
01:04:19.074 --> 01:04:23.074
And the body is more important than clothes.

179
01:04:23.154 --> 01:04:26.154
Look at the birds.

180
01:04:26.154 --> 01:04:33.154
They do not sow, they do not reap, and they do not store away in barns.

181
01:04:33.154 --> 01:04:37.154
The heavenly Father provides for them to eat.

182
01:04:37.154 --> 01:04:43.154
He always provides, it will naturally be autumn and winter and spring and summer again.

183
01:04:43.154 --> 01:04:46.154
And all the birds have just enough to eat.

184
01:04:46.154 --> 01:04:49.154
They don’t have to worry about that.

185
01:04:49.234 --> 01:04:52.234
Your heavenly Father provides for them to eat.

186
01:04:52.234 --> 01:04:55.234
You are much more important than birds, aren’t you?

187
01:04:55.234 --> 01:04:57.234
Yes, I think so.

188
01:04:57.234 --> 01:05:01.234
Although, when I see a poor little bird, I want to take care of it.

189
01:05:01.234 --> 01:05:05.234
We are much more important to God the Father.

190
01:05:09.234 --> 01:05:13.234
And why do you worry about clothes?

191
01:05:13.234 --> 01:05:15.234
Look at the flowers in the grass.

192
01:05:15.234 --> 01:05:17.234
Look at how they grow.

193
01:05:17.314 --> 01:05:19.314
Look at how they grow.

194
01:05:19.314 --> 01:05:21.314
They do not work and they do not weave.

195
01:05:21.314 --> 01:05:24.314
That flower is not going to say at the beginning of the season,

196
01:05:24.314 --> 01:05:27.314
will I be pink or blue or yellow today?

197
01:05:27.314 --> 01:05:29.314
It doesn’t worry about that.

198
01:05:29.314 --> 01:05:33.314
As it is made by God, so is that flower.

199
01:05:35.314 --> 01:05:37.314
The grass only stands for one day.

200
01:05:37.314 --> 01:05:39.314
Then you have to mow it again.

201
01:05:39.314 --> 01:05:43.314
And then tomorrow it's fuel in the oven.

202
01:05:43.394 --> 01:05:47.394
Yet God dresses the grass so beautifully with those flowers.

203
01:05:47.394 --> 01:05:51.394
Then He will clothe you too, won't He?

204
01:05:51.394 --> 01:05:54.394
What is your faith so small, says the Word.

205
01:05:54.394 --> 01:05:57.394
Do not be anxious about anything.

206
01:05:57.394 --> 01:05:59.394
Do not worry.

207
01:05:59.394 --> 01:06:02.394
And that is really a big thing nowadays.

208
01:06:02.394 --> 01:06:04.394
Worrying.

209
01:06:04.394 --> 01:06:07.394
You can speak to your own thoughts.

210
01:06:07.394 --> 01:06:09.394
Just tell yourself.

211
01:06:09.474 --> 01:06:12.474
Hey, stop worrying for a moment.

212
01:06:12.474 --> 01:06:14.474
Stop that for a while.

213
01:06:14.474 --> 01:06:17.474
And then just grab the Bible and say.

214
01:06:17.474 --> 01:06:20.474
Because we have said that more often in recent weeks.

215
01:06:20.474 --> 01:06:22.474
For every situation, there is a Bible verse.

216
01:06:22.474 --> 01:06:26.474
Grab that Bible and say stop worrying.

217
01:06:26.474 --> 01:06:30.474
The Bible provides the solution.

218
01:06:30.474 --> 01:06:32.474
God provides the solution.

219
01:06:32.474 --> 01:06:34.474
He takes care of us.

220
01:06:34.474 --> 01:06:37.474
So let us not worry.

221
01:06:37.554 --> 01:06:39.554
The next one.

222
01:06:39.554 --> 01:06:43.554
The people of other nations do worry.

223
01:06:43.554 --> 01:06:48.554
But your Heavenly Father knows what you need.

224
01:06:48.554 --> 01:06:54.554
We have talked quite a bit about giving tithes lately.

225
01:06:54.554 --> 01:06:56.554
And sometimes you might think.

226
01:06:56.554 --> 01:06:59.554
For someone who is very rich, that is easy.

227
01:06:59.554 --> 01:07:01.554
But I am dirt poor.

228
01:07:01.554 --> 01:07:03.554
I can't do all that.

229
01:07:03.554 --> 01:07:06.554
Or everything in between, of course.

230
01:07:06.634 --> 01:07:09.634
But God says do not worry.

231
01:07:09.634 --> 01:07:13.634
And whether you are filthy rich or dirt poor.

232
01:07:13.634 --> 01:07:18.634
Worrying is something that we all do in this western world anyway.

233
01:07:18.634 --> 01:07:21.634
And God says do not do that.

234
01:07:21.634 --> 01:07:23.634
I care for you.

235
01:07:23.634 --> 01:07:26.634
And when we talk about giving here.

236
01:07:26.634 --> 01:07:30.634
It is also to challenge you.

237
01:07:30.634 --> 01:07:33.634
To say trust Him.

238
01:07:33.634 --> 01:07:35.634
Trust Him.

239
01:07:35.714 --> 01:07:37.714
Give Him what is due to Him.

240
01:07:37.714 --> 01:07:40.714
The Bible also speaks about that.

241
01:07:40.714 --> 01:07:43.714
That we can give back to God what belongs to Him.

242
01:07:43.714 --> 01:07:46.714
